   $OUT/tokens.json as [[ids of sequence 0], ...]. The check sets those four variables (a
   natural-text prompt, the tokens it scores); read them from the environment, no defaults.
   It runs the checkpoint at its own precision (converted without loss when the framework
   needs its own format), never quantized: the check judges the port, and a quantization's
   error would hide a defect in it or fail a correct one.{% if quantization is defined and quantization != "auto" %}{% if dequantized %}
